  m_Name: DemoYesNo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Dialogue.DialogueNode
  speakerName: Boss
  dialogueType: 1
  advanceDialogueDatabase: 1
  lines:
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: -5629209291032929933, guid: 0aa531942dc074c4f8b134a329da5e54, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -7092260930629485070, guid: 03c7343961272c342a477ddf234e61c2, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: Hey I am the boss... I look like i'm angry and neutral every few seconds.
      I know it might look weird but I trust the artists could help with that!
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: -5629209291032929933, guid: 0aa531942dc074c4f8b134a329da5e54, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: Of course I can still only one sprite that is then not animated, the developer
      is quite smart!
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: -7092260930629485070, guid: 03c7343961272c342a477ddf234e61c2, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -5629209291032929933, guid: 0aa531942dc074c4f8b134a329da5e54, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: You can also decide to animate me with more frames per second! Crazy right?
      Now you will get a yes/no question to answer to try the new animations. I believe
      you will want to change the artwork for them because it's quite... UGLY...
    typingSpeed: 1
  ChoicePortraits: []
  ChoicePortraitAnimationFPS: 8
